---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";

const lastUpdated = "October 13, 2026";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — VarianceCalc"
  description="VarianceCalc's privacy policy. All calculations run in your browser — no data is uploaded, logged, or stored on our servers. The site may show Google AdSense ads."
  skipTo="main-content"
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: "Privacy Policy", path: "/privacy-policy" }]}
>
  <SiteHeader currentPath="/privacy-policy" />

  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="border-b border-hairline">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 pt-16 pb-12 sm:px-6 sm:pt-20">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-ink sm:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-mute">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="border-b border-hairline">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-8 px-5 py-14 text-base leading-relaxed text-body sm:px-6 sm:py-16">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">The short version</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            VarianceCalc performs every calculation locally in your browser. The numbers
            you paste or type are never sent to, processed by, or stored on our servers —
            that data never leaves your browser. This site shows ads through Google
            AdSense, which may use cookies to serve and measure ads; see the "Advertising"
            section below for details.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Your calculator data</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            The dataset you enter into the calculator stays in your browser's memory and
            is never transmitted anywhere automatically. The only exception is if you
            explicitly click "Copy link" to share a result — that action encodes your
            data and selected mode into the page URL (as <code class="font-mono text-sm">?d=</code> and
            <code class="font-mono text-sm">?m=</code> query parameters) so it can be shared or
            bookmarked. Simply typing, pasting, or editing data never changes the address bar
            on its own.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Local storage</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            We use your browser's local storage to remember one thing: your light or dark
            theme preference. This stays on your device and is never transmitted to us.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Server logs and hosting</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Like any website, our hosting provider may automatically log standard technical
            information for security and reliability purposes — such as IP address, browser
            type, and request timestamps — for pages you request. This is standard web server
            behavior and is not tied to any calculator data, which never leaves your browser.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Advertising</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            This site shows ads served by Google AdSense. Google and its advertising
            partners may use cookies and similar technologies to serve ads based on your
            prior visits to this or other websites, and to measure ad performance. This
            advertising activity is separate from the calculator itself — your calculator
            data is never shared with or used by any advertiser, because it never leaves
            your browser in the first place. You can learn more about how Google uses
            data, and opt out of personalized advertising, at
            <a
              href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads"
              class="text-link hover:underline"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Ads Policy page</a
            > and at
            <a
              href="https://adssettings.google.com"
              class="text-link hover:underline"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a
            >.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Cookies</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Beyond the local theme preference described above, this site uses cookies
            associated with Google AdSense, as described in the "Advertising" section
            above.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Third parties</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            We do not sell, rent, or share your calculator data with third parties, because
            we do not collect any calculator input to begin with. Google AdSense, described
            above, operates independently of the calculator and has its own privacy
            practices. If this ever changes — for example, if we introduce analytics — we
            will update this policy accordingly.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Children's privacy</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            This site is a general-purpose calculator and does not knowingly collect
            personal information from anyone, including children.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            If this policy changes, we will update this page and revise the "Last updated"
            date above.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Contact</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Questions about this policy? Visit our
            <a href="/contact" class="text-link hover:underline">Contact Us</a> page.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <SiteFooter />
</Layout>
